  https://github.com/openai/whisper
  The `asr whisper` engine ports the Whisper transcription pipeline. The mel
  filterbanks and byte-pair-encoding vocabularies embedded in the binary
  (trakktor_core/src/asr/whisper/assets/) are taken from Whisper. Whisper model
  weights are downloaded from Hugging Face at runtime and are not redistributed
