  https://huggingface.co/bond005/whisper-podlodka-turbo
  https://huggingface.co/bond005/whisper-large-v3-ru-podlodka
  The `asr whisper` models `podlodka-turbo` and `podlodka` are these Russian
  fine-tunes of Whisper large-v3-turbo and large-v3. Their word-alignment
  head tables (trakktor_core/src/asr/whisper/assets.rs) are taken from the
  checkpoints' generation configs. Model weights are downloaded from Hugging
  Face at runtime and are not redistributed in this repository.

