  (encoder/decoder/joiner) and the SentencePiece token table — are downloaded
  from Hugging Face (alphacep/vosk-model-*) at runtime and are not
  redistributed in this repository.

Zipformer2 / k2-fsa/icefall — Apache-2.0 License
  Copyright (c) 2021-2024 Xiaomi Corporation
  https://github.com/k2-fsa/icefall
  The Zipformer2 encoder and the stateless-transducer decoder/joiner ported by
