kaldi-native-fbank — Apache-2.0 License
  Copyright (c) 2022-2024 Xiaomi Corporation (authors: Fangjun Kuang)
  https://github.com/csukuangfj/kaldi-native-fbank
  The Kaldi-compatible log-mel fbank front end of the `asr vosk` engine (povey
